{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom02_title", "source_sha256": "955b93981cf8567b3d59061cdf5a36c3b68c082db7eec6969fd3bacf77a32190", "ja": "朋花とおでかけ2", "zh": "和朋花外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "715245c595257a7eea08a1e219c8528107b9ad40f40ca3fc6719361c3e960e7d", "ja": "朋花とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和朋花出门外出的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f5a0b30545eae3d633c273c0331063d813efed11b3fee8ced5fcbf511b9952f9", "ja": "（駅まで朋花を迎えに来る予定が、打ち合わせが\n長引いて遅れてしまった……なんたる失態だ！）", "zh": "（本来计划去车站接朋花的，没想到商谈拖得太久，结果迟到了……真是太失态了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e25b427d1dc63bf50e5cc661071699f2e13d5e86be93527fa8515c638d6d166b", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。と、朋花！　遅れてすまない！", "zh": "哈、哈……朋花！抱歉，我迟到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "04fd57585953b916f355af675aa33b3e26dde399310a2e2665a84f855e78de52", "ja": "やっぱり怒ってるか？　怒ってるよな……\n予定をちゃんと聞いてたのに、本当にすまない。", "zh": "果然还是生气了吗？肯定生气了吧……\n明明之前都好好确认过日程了，真的很对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom02_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "7de3cc132914973458b8be8f3905a379fcea77a2e395533fdb00a8b8360ad42e", "ja": "仕事の打ち合わせなら、仕方がありません～。\nちゃんと連絡はくれていましたし……。", "zh": "如果是工作上的讨论，那也没办法～。\n你确实有好好联系我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom02_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "5edccbf33f29b43c45c3dd49684a27a87f1097cf222235b488d6eb04441ec927", "ja": "それより……聖母に謝りたいなら、\n言葉ではなく、行動で示してもらわないと～？", "zh": "比起这个……如果想向圣母道歉，就不能只靠嘴上说说，而得用行动来证明哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "90807b2803cbf4eac5689958c319713287f64dd6715e843b4a38c82d3c05664e", "ja": "行動……そ、そうだな。ええと……。", "zh": "行动……是、是这样。那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom02_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "87bfb855d30a39c42943950c050f7725adf8526dd0a00f0aa9373bab3a2b84c8", "ja": "罰として……{$P$}さんには、\n水族館に連れて行ってもらおうと思います～。", "zh": "作为惩罚……我想让{$P$}先生带我去水族馆～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom02_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "ad9f6627473a2d4454f8cc8dc194c325fc5a072c8907190a645e0dc356bac244", "ja": "なんでも、テッポウウオのショーというのが\nあるそうですよ～。ふふっ、楽しみですね～♪", "zh": "听说那里还有射水鱼表演呢～呵呵，真让人期待啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e90a8c3c642c79f0e1db889909023e2f364ce0101f16e5bf8b90bf1a910d4828", "ja": "（よかった、許された……！　これからは\n朋花に心細い思いをさせないよう、気をつけないとな）", "zh": "（太好了，她原谅我了……！以后可得注意，不能再让朋花感到不安了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
